cSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动Seedance2.5模型将于7月16日全量开放API接口</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，三档定价策略重塑AI开发性价比</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta携手博通与台积电，自研AI数据中心处理器Iris将于9月量产</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波发布具身原生世界动作模型LingBot-VA2.0，实现150Hz实时推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1055411e2fc014ec248a3be0fb47835d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月10日，蚂蚁灵波发布业界首个具身原生世界动作模型LingBot-VA2.0，标志着机器人基础模型从“数字世界模型构建”转向“物理世界原生设计”。该模型摒弃了传统视频生成模型的微调路线，采用自回归架构从零预训练，通过语义视觉-动作Tokenizer、因果预训练范式、MoE架构及异步推理机制，实现了单卡150Hz的实时推理效率。LingBot-VA2.0在真机测试中展现了卓越的动态建模与因果预测能力，支持机器人完成复杂的多轮实时交互。蚂蚁灵波CEO朱兴表示，该模型作为全栈大脑2.0的集大成者，将加速具身智能在产业场景的落地。此外，蚂蚁灵波近期还发布并开源了LingBot-Vision、LingBot-Depth2.0、LingBot-VLA2.0、LingBot-World2.0及LingBot-Video等系</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果接洽PrismML评估端侧AI技术，实现27B大模型在iPhone 17 Pro上运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/21b4950880151a7a617ad647002b3a2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正与AI初创公司PrismML接洽，评估其原生1-bit模型压缩技术在iPhone端侧运行大规模AI模型的可行性。PrismML的核心技术通过将模型权重压缩至仅含负1和正1，在不保留高精度逃生通道的前提下，将模型体积缩减至全精度版本的约十四分之一，内存占用降低超90%。实测显示，该技术使推理速度提升最高8倍，能耗降低75%至80%。目前，PrismML已成功将阿里巴巴开源的27B参数模型Qwen 3.6压缩并完整运行于iPhone 17 Pro上，且保持了接近FP16的推理精度。若该技术落地，将显著提升Apple Intelligence的端侧处理能力，使iPhone无需依赖云端即可运行更大规模模型，支持更复杂的智能体任务与多轮对话，有望重塑端侧AI与云端AI的算力格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动Seedance2.5模型将于7月16日全量开放API接口</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8a99773646ec407ef9c7515421df4da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日正式全量开放API，标志着该模型从灰度测试阶段迈向全面商用。Seedance2.5在技术层面实现显著突破，支持30秒单段原生视频直出，大幅提升了视频连贯性；多模态融合能力增强，支持最高50个全模态素材参考，强化了复杂场景的上下文理解。此外，该模型引入了更具可控性的视频生成与编辑功能，支持创作者对画面主体和运镜进行精准微调。目前，字节旗下AI创作平台“即梦”已开启上线预热，并计划配套推出会员折扣与积分优惠活动。行业分析认为，随着长视频直出与高可控性技术的演进，Seedance2.5的全量商用将加速AI视频工具在影视创意及商业广告领域的工程化落地进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，三档定价策略重塑AI开发性价比</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c493c4636b6ed89435c6afaf53b4e36.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月10日正式向全球全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，涵盖旗舰版Sol、均衡版Terra及性价比版Luna三款产品，并于24小时内覆盖ChatGPT、Codex及API。定价方面，三款模型每百万Token输入/输出价格分别为5/30美元、2.5/15美元及1/6美元，其中Luna价格仅为Anthropic Fable5的十六分之一。性能上，Sol在Agents&#x27; Last Exam评测中以53.6分超越Fable5，并在Artificial Analysis编程智能体指数中以80分刷新纪录。尽管Sol在SWE-Bench Pro及FrontierMath Tier4等深度工程与前沿数学领域表现不及Fable5，但其引入的ultra模式支持最多16个智能体并行，在BrowseComp测试中以92.2%</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta携手博通与台积电，自研AI数据中心处理器Iris将于9月量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a888e54478a5ec44d449e7d667c3695a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正与博通（Broadcom）及台积电（TSMC）深度合作，计划于2026年9月正式量产代号为“Iris”的自研AI数据中心处理器。该芯片隶属于Meta定制化自主基础设施（MTIA）项目，旨在优化Facebook和Instagram的内容排序、推荐系统及生成式算法，以降低对第三方GPU的依赖。Iris已通过六周的初始漏洞测试，Meta计划保持每六个月一次的迭代节奏。为保障供应链安全，Meta已与三星、闪迪及住友电气签署长期供应合同，并规划2026年基础设施资本支出达145亿美元，目标在2026年底前部署7吉瓦计算容量，并在2027年翻倍至14吉瓦。此举标志着Meta在算力军备竞赛中迈出关键一步，通过自研硬件提升独立AI生态的自主权，有效对冲全球硬件短缺与“芯片通胀”带来的供应链风险。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
